WEBVTT

00:12:59.733 --> 00:13:02.611
You have to trust in their ability

00:13:02.611 --> 00:13:06.323
to manage the areas
of their own expertise and interests.

00:13:06.824 --> 00:13:08.242
And by doing so,

00:13:08.283 --> 00:13:12.913
you earn their commitment and agency
to make this project work.

00:13:14.122 --> 00:13:15.958
It also requires humility

00:13:15.958 --> 00:13:18.544
because you're going to get it wrong
some of the times.

00:13:18.585 --> 00:13:20.379
But getting it wrong some of the time

00:13:20.379 --> 00:13:23.423
is worth it for getting it right
most of the time.

00:13:24.174 --> 00:13:25.968
And speaking of time,

00:13:26.009 --> 00:13:29.721
you have to have a very different
relationship to urgency.